    "title": "RESULTS: Clark and Chawla elected - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Reed Nye ,\n1 days ago ESSEX JUNCTION — Voters passed eight of nine ballot articles and elected Bethany Clark and Raj Chawla over incumbent Marcus Certa with 857 and 847 votes to 649 for three-year City Council terms. According to preliminary election results, a total of 1,439 voters cast their ballots for Annual Meeting... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
